    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/f07caa27dab25aeb5b7e011aea52bd6b.poster.avif?t=1739661107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/f07caa27dab25aeb5b7e011aea52bd6b.webm?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/f07caa27dab25aeb5b7e011aea52bd6b.mp4?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bikini Alert</strong> is a fast-paced run-and-gun action game where you must survive against relentless waves of robotic enemies responsible for driving humanity underground. No one knows exactly who created these machines or what their true purpose is, but with resources running out, humanity has no choice but to fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>Cyne Rizerous</strong>, a fearless young man who has never seen the open sky. Determined to save the last <strong>Supply Collector Team</strong>, he takes up arms and joins the battle. At his command is <strong>Leviatan</strong>, a powerful vehicle that can instantly transform into a heavily armed combat mech. But as he fights for survival, his curiosity may uncover a long-buried truth about humanity\u2019s past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/1e17b55d2170cb67557cd45427b14958.poster.avif?t=1739661107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/1e17b55d2170cb67557cd45427b14958.webm?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/1e17b55d2170cb67557cd45427b14958.mp4?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-apocalyptic environments</strong> \u2013 Explore a devastated world overrun by machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bullet hell action</strong> \u2013 Dodge waves of enemy fire in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic boss fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against massive bosses and challenging minibosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mission selection</strong> \u2013 Replay unlocked levels to train and improve your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random power-ups</strong> \u2013 Discover spread shots, mini-drones, shields, armor restoration, and the devastating laser flamethrower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable collectibles</strong> \u2013 Find bobblehead decorations, Leviatan skins, and unique explosion effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gallery mode</strong> \u2013 Unlock stunning game illustrations after boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/fb0178a44ee8393d53ab09e5788f7a98.poster.avif?t=1739661107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/fb0178a44ee8393d53ab09e5788f7a98.webm?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/fb0178a44ee8393d53ab09e5788f7a98.mp4?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Bikini Alert&quot; refers to an official UK Ministry of Defense alert used for unspecified threats. While the game plays on this term with a double meaning, it is <strong>not</strong> a mature-rated game.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/f07caa27dab25aeb5b7e011aea52bd6b.poster.avif?t=1739661107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/f07caa27dab25aeb5b7e011aea52bd6b.webm?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/f07caa27dab25aeb5b7e011aea52bd6b.mp4?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bikini Alert</strong> is a fast-paced run-and-gun action game where you must survive against relentless waves of robotic enemies responsible for driving humanity underground. No one knows exactly who created these machines or what their true purpose is, but with resources running out, humanity has no choice but to fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <strong>Cyne Rizerous</strong>, a fearless young man who has never seen the open sky. Determined to save the last <strong>Supply Collector Team</strong>, he takes up arms and joins the battle. At his command is <strong>Leviatan</strong>, a powerful vehicle that can instantly transform into a heavily armed combat mech. But as he fights for survival, his curiosity may uncover a long-buried truth about humanity\u2019s past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/1e17b55d2170cb67557cd45427b14958.poster.avif?t=1739661107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/1e17b55d2170cb67557cd45427b14958.webm?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/1e17b55d2170cb67557cd45427b14958.mp4?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-apocalyptic environments</strong> \u2013 Explore a devastated world overrun by machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bullet hell action</strong> \u2013 Dodge waves of enemy fire in intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic boss fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against massive bosses and challenging minibosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mission selection</strong> \u2013 Replay unlocked levels to train and improve your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random power-ups</strong> \u2013 Discover spread shots, mini-drones, shields, armor restoration, and the devastating laser flamethrower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable collectibles</strong> \u2013 Find bobblehead decorations, Leviatan skins, and unique explosion effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gallery mode</strong> \u2013 Unlock stunning game illustrations after boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/fb0178a44ee8393d53ab09e5788f7a98.poster.avif?t=1739661107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/fb0178a44ee8393d53ab09e5788f7a98.webm?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1292560/extras/fb0178a44ee8393d53ab09e5788f7a98.mp4?t=1739661107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Bikini Alert&quot; refers to an official UK Ministry of Defense alert used for unspecified threats. While the game plays on this term with a double meaning, it is <strong>not</strong> a mature-rated game.</i></p>",
